    <!-- REQ-032 rule 1 (pending chg-draft-req032-how-to-play-text.md: at most 60 words): the design's 59-word draft. -->
    <string name="how_to_text">Drag a piece from the tray onto the shape. Tap a piece to turn it; while dragging, twist it with a second finger. The badge beside the parallelogram flips it. A dropped piece snaps into place or goes back to the tray. Fill the shape to see its picture. Press the number at the top to see all puzzles.</string>
